    "Tabs that play media, use the camera or microphone, are in full screen, or contain unsent text stay awake. When the Mac runs low on memory, inactive tabs sleep sooner.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tabs that play media, use the camera or microphone, are in full screen, or contain unsent text stay awake. When the Mac runs low on memory, inactive tabs sleep sooner."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les onglets qui lisent un média, utilisent la caméra ou le micro, sont en plein écran ou contiennent du texte non envoyé restent actifs. Quand le Mac manque de mémoire, les onglets inactifs se mettent en veille plus tôt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terracotta": {
